&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own your team’s revenue performance, setting ambitious goals and creating the focus, accountability, and operating rhythm needed to deliver against them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and develop an exceptional team of Strategic Account Executives through thoughtful hiring, hands-on coaching, and regular, actionable feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay close to your most important accounts and opportunities, helping shape deal and account strategy and building trusted relationships with senior customer executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own forecasting and planning for your business, bringing rigor to pipeline management and using data and judgment to identify where your team needs to focus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner across Sales, Customer Success, Solution Engineering, Product, and other teams to remove barriers, surface customer needs, and improve how we serve and sell to our largest customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape the way the Strategic Sales organization operates, identifying opportunities to improve the structures, processes, and ways of working that enable the team to scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring 8+ years of quota-carrying sales experience in technology, ideally SaaS, with a strong track record of selling to and closing large enterprise accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have people management experience and a track record of building and leading high-performing sales teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re an exceptional coach. You can diagnose what’s holding a seller or deal back, give clear and actionable feedback, and adapt your approach to help different people perform at their best.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong commercial judgment. You know when to go deep on a deal, when to challenge your team’s thinking, and when to bring in the right stakeholders to change the trajectory of an opportunity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You combine strategic thinking with operational rigor. You can see the bigger picture while staying close to pipeline, forecasting, account strategy, and the details that ultimately drive performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a strong communicator and relationship builder. You can earn credibility with senior customer executives, create alignment across internal teams, and communicate clearly when priorities or perspectives differ.&lt;/li&gt;
